		{
			"statement": "Détermine la mesure principale de l'angle orienté de mesure $\\frac{ {{a}}\\pi}{6}$, c'est-à-dire sa mesure dans l'intervalle $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$.\n\n$?$",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "\\frac{\\pi}{6}|-\\frac{\\pi}{6}|\\frac{5\\pi}{6}|-\\frac{5\\pi}{6}"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "eval:6*r/\\pi"
				},
				{
					"name": "k",
					"expression": "1..3"
				},
				{
					"name": "a",
					"expression": "eval:p+12*k"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "{{r}}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On retire des tours complets ($2\\pi=\\frac{12\\pi}{6}$) jusqu'à tomber dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ :",
					"$$\\frac{ {{a}}\\pi}{6}={{r}}+\\frac{ {{eval:12*k}}\\pi}{6}={{r}}+{{eval:2*k}}\\pi$$",
					"Comme ${{r}}\\in\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$, la mesure principale est $\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{{{r}} }$.",
					"```trig\npreset: custom\nangles: {{p}}*pi/6\n```"
				]
			}
		},
